<softwarelist name="hector2hr_cass" description="Micronique Hector 2HR cassettes">
<!--
Software for the Micronique Hector 2HR computer, also compatible with the Hector HRX and Hector MX.

There are 2 different methods for loading software:

1. Software which can be loaded by selecting the CASSETTE option in the menu and starting the tape.

2. Software which requires BASIC to be loaded first. 
   For the HRX, BASIC 3X needs to be loaded first from tape using the first option above.
   For the HR2 (BASIC III) and MX (BASIC 3X) it can be selected from the menu. 
   Once basic loads, type LOAD, then ENTER and start the tape. 
   If required, select RUN then ENTER once loading completes.
-->

